# Structure with punctuation

Literal punctuation\: \<br\> \& \[square\] \(round\) **star**\.


First hard break  
Second line\.


> Quoted first line\. Quoted second line\.


Verse first line  
Verse second line


-  [ ] unchecked task
-  [X] checked task
  -  Nested item
1.  Ordered first
2.  Ordered second


| Cell | Content |
| --- | --- |
| Pipe | left\\\|right |
| Break | first\\\\ |


